<header><p class="enc-kicker">Event</p><h1 class="enc-title">Surrender at Világos</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1849">1849</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Surrender at Világos took place on 13 August 1849, when the Hungarian army under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/artur-gorgei">Artúr Görgei</a> laid down its arms to the Russian forces that had intervened on the Austrian side. It effectively ended the Hungarian war of independence of 1848-1849. Világos is now Șiria in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/romania">Romania</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/surrender-at-vilagos.jpg" alt="Surrender at Világos" width="320" height="248" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vil%C3%A1gosi_fegyverlet%C3%A9tel.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
